@page "/"

<PageTitle>FaultDesk</PageTitle>

<section class="fd-hero mb-4">
    <div class="section-label mb-2" style="color: var(--fd-pink-100);">Garage fault triage</div>
    <h1>Turn <span class="accent">"it makes a funny noise"</span><br />into a job the workshop can start.</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 mt-3">
        Customers describe the problem in their own words. FaultDesk finds the vehicle, asks the right follow-up
        questions, triages the fault, surfaces similar faults the garage has already fixed and drafts an investigation plan.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="row g-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100 portal-card">
            <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="icon">C</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="section-label pink">For customers</div>
                        <h2 class="h5 mb-0">Report a problem</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-secondary flex-grow-1">
                    Enter your registration, check the vehicle we find, tell us what's wrong and answer a couple of
                    quick questions. Takes about a minute.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary align-self-start" href="customer/report">Start a report</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100 portal-card">
            <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="icon">G</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="section-label pink">For the workshop</div>
                        <h2 class="h5 mb-0">Garage portal</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-secondary flex-grow-1">
                    Every ticket with its triage, the vehicle's history, similar faults you've seen before and an
                    AI-generated investigation plan, all on one screen.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-dark align-self-start" href="garage">Open the garage portal</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
